            "applied_patch": "--- a/rtl/sequence.sv\n+++ b/rtl/sequence.sv\n@@ -45,7 +45,7 @@\n \n     end\n     // if it overflows, set overflow_out to be 1\n-    if(enable == 1'b0 && counter_out == 4'b1111)\n+    if(counter_out == 4'b1111)\n     begin\n         overflow_out <= 1'b1;\n     end\n",
            "public_rows": {
              "W_bug": "visible_pass",
              "W_preserve": "visible_pass"
            },
            "specification_excerpt": "Four-bit up counter on rising clk. Synchronous active-high reset clears count and overflow; enable increments count modulo 16, otherwise count holds. The independent overflow test observes the pre-edge count: if it is 15, set sticky overflow even when enable is high. Overflow holds until reset; preserve the original delayed counter assignments and reset/overflow scheduling. Preserve interface and comments.\n",
            "validation": "public_pass_single_sample_hidden_unknown"
          },
